Interface to receive notification from other oneM2M entities.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Application that receives notification must implement this interface and
 register to OSGi service registry. No service property is required.</fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.onem2m.NotificationListener.notified-RequestPrimitiveDTO-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
